Validation: small source/content and JavaScript syntax check only. Browser/runtime behavior, actual codec playback, moving-frame crop/contrast, loop boundaries, focus/interaction and responsive rendering are unverified; central observer owns qualification. No browser, server, installation, external service or second verification workflow used.
EOF"
